<title>USA: R.O.C. Taiwan says holders reject proposal.</title>
<headline>R.O.C. Taiwan says holders reject proposal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>R.O.C. Taiwan Fund said Wednesday that its shareholders voted against converting to an open-end fund.</p>
<p>About 11.7 percent of the outstanding shares voted in favor of the proposal, the company said.</p>
</text>
